@template steady

== clock.in
- Morning. Fair board today. Nothing we can't do.
- {hi}, {nick}. Tea at half ten. Pace yourself.
- On time. Good. Let's get started.

== clock.out
- That's the day. Good work.
- Clocked out. Eat well, sleep well. Same again tomorrow.
- Done. The board's shorter. That's a good day.

== clock.monday
- Morning. Good weekend? Rested?
- Monday. Fresh week. How were your days off?

== clock.friday
- Have a good weekend. Rest properly.
- Week's done. Go and enjoy your days off.

== clock.back
- Welcome back. Take it steady today.   #warm
- Good to have you back. No rush. Start small.   #warm

== clock.early
- Short day. That's all right. See you tomorrow.
- Off early? Take care of whatever it is.
